Note on imagery and data
------------------------

The frames in `data/records/` and the NASA-derived content rendered by the live
tuner are products of NASA's Scientific Visualization Studio (SVS), the Earth
Information Center content database, and NASA Global Imagery Browse Services
(GIBS). NASA content is generally not subject to copyright in the United States
and may be used without permission; please credit NASA and the individual
visualizers named in each record's liner notes.

This project uses no NASA logos, insignia, or the NASA "meatball" mark. Its
name and visual identity are the work of the project, not NASA's, and this
project is not endorsed by NASA. The Space Apps Challenge is NASA's programme;
this repository is a participant submission to it.

No third-party audio samples, fonts, or JavaScript libraries are included. All
sound is synthesised by `src/sonify.js`, and the page loads no external
resources apart from NASA GIBS imagery when the live tuner is used.
